<title>JAPAN: Organo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Organo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.54		vs	   33.14</p>
<p> Operating	    1.42		vs	    1.59</p>
<p> Current		1.42		vs	    1.55</p>
<p> Net		  825    million    vs	  809    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.24 yen	  vs	   13.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     58 million	  vs	  58 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Organo Corp manufactures water-treatment equipment and is affiliated with Tosoh Corp.</p>
